#: 4f6077ccee6c4cd0b050724399699a5a
msgid "**Target**: `run_mcmc`, `GLS`"
msgstr "**対象**: `run_mcmc`, `GLS`"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:194
#: 454acbbe5d9847258d2c0b9f82ec0d18
msgid ""
"For complex-valued residuals, the MCMC likelihood path assumes a Hermitian "
"quadratic form `r.conj() @ cov_inv @ r` and then takes the real part. In "
"practice, this means the API can accept complex residual vectors without "
"silently dropping the imaginary component."
msgstr ""
"MCMC の対数尤度計算では、複素残差に対してもエルミート形式 `r.conj() @ cov_inv @ r` "
"の実部を用いる実装を前提にしています。つまり、**複素データを API にそのまま渡した場合でも、内部では複素共役を考慮した二次形式で評価**されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:197
#: 625c27c81bb24410a391bfe9f74d77c7
msgid "`cov_inv` should be close to Hermitian positive-definite."
msgstr "共分散行列 `cov_inv` がエルミート正定値に近いこと。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/validated_algorithms.md:198
#: f3889ecf0bfc417f826cd954fb5e3246
msgid ""
"The implementation is intended for a circular-complex-Gaussian-style "
"treatment of residuals rather than a naive \"real-part only\" model."
msgstr "複素残差は circular complex Gaussian に準じた扱いを想定しており、単純に実部だけへ切り捨てる挙動ではありません。"

